{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017Hb4QMNwdpECeCkSEWRRU9","type":"tool_result","content":"1161\t                let main_ptrs: Vec<MainMatrixPtrs<EF>> = mats[first_main_idx..]\n1162\t                    .iter()\n1163\t                    .map(|m| {\n1164\t                        let main_ptr = MainMatrixPtrs {\n1165\t                            data: interpolated\n1166\t                                .buffer()\n1167\t                                .as_ptr()\n1168\t                                .wrapping_add(widths_so_far * interpolated_height),\n1169\t                            air_width: air_width_for_mat(need_rot, m.width()),\n1170\t                        };\n1171\t                        widths_so_far += m.width();\n1172\t                        main_ptr\n1173\t                    })\n1174\t                    .collect_vec();\n1175\t                debug_assert_eq!(widths_so_far, interpolated.width());\n1176\t                let main_ptrs_dev = main_ptrs.to_device()?;\n1177\t\n1178\t                _keepalive_interpolated.push(interpolated);\n1179\t                let eq_xi_ptr = eq_xi_tree.get_ptr(log_num_y);\n1180\t\n1181\t                early_eval.push(TraceCtx {\n1182\t                    trace_idx,\n1183\t                    air_idx,\n1184\t                    n_lift,\n1185\t                    num_y: num_y as u32,\n1186\t                    has_constraints,\n1187\t                    has_interactions,\n1188\t                    norm_factor,\n1189\t                    eq_xi_ptr,\n1190\t                    sels_ptr,\n1191\t                    prep_ptr,\n1192\t                    main_ptrs_dev,\n1193\t                    public_ptr: public_vals.as_ptr(),\n1194\t                    eq_3bs_ptr: eq_3bs.as_ptr(),\n1195\t                });\n1196\t            }\n1197\t        }\n1198\t\n1199\t        let d_challenges_ptr = self.d_challenges.as_ptr();\n1200\t\n1201\t        // Late traces (num_y=1): always use monomial