362\n           for j in 0..trace.width() {\n               unstacked_cols.push(UnstackedSlice { ... });  // Per-column metadata\n           }\n       }\n   }\n   ```\n\n### 4. **The Per-AIR Processing Loop: Where Work Happens**\n\n#### **Round 0: Univariate Sumcheck** (stacked_reduction.rs:484-559)\n\n**File**: `/home/georg/stark-backend/crates/cuda-backend/src/stacked_reduction.rs:508-552`\n\nPer-AIR kernel launch pattern:\n```rust\nfor ((trace_ptr, trace_height, trace_width), window) in zip(\n    mem::take(&mut self.trace_ptrs),\n    self.ht_diff_idxs.windows(2),  // One window per AIR\n) {\n    let n = log_height as isize - l_skip as isize;\n    let d_g_output = if n >= 0 {\n        &mut d_g_pos\n    } else {\n        &mut d_g_neg[(-n - 1) as usize]\n    };\n    \n    unsafe {\n        stacked_reduction_sumcheck_round0(\n            &self.eq_r_ns,\n            trace_ptr,              // Per-AIR trace pointer\n            lambda_pows_ptr,        // Lambda powers for this AIR's columns\n            &mut self.d_block_sums, // Shared temporary buffer\n            d_g_output,             // Output bucket (shared)\n            trace_height,           // Per-AIR height\n            trace_width,            // Per-AIR width\n            l_skip,\n        )\n    }\n}\n```\n\n**GPU Kernel** (`stacked_reduction_sumcheck_round0`): \n- **File**: `/home/georg/stark-backend/crates/cuda-backend/src/cuda/stacked_reduction.rs:102-127`\n- **CUDA Code**: externally defined via FFI (`_stacked_reduction_sumcheck_round0`)\n- **Per-AIR**: One kernel launch per AIR\n- **Output**: Partial sums (G0, G1, G2) accumulated into shared buckets based on trace height (`n = log_height - l_skip`)\n\n**CPU-Side Reconstruction** (stacked_reduction.rs:554-644):\n\nAfter all per-AIR kernels complete:\n```rust\nlet s_0 = self.reconstruct_s0_from_g(d_g_pos, d_g_neg, s_0_deg)?;  // Line 555\n```\n\nThis performs NTT-based polynomial multiplication on CPU:\n- **File**: `/home/georg/stark-backend/crates/cuda-backend/src/stacked_reduction.rs:569-644`\n- **Work**: NTT, polynomial multiplications for each height bucket (n >= 0 and n < 0)\n- **Output**: `s_0` coefficients (univariate polynomial of degree ~`l_skip`)\n\n#### **Round 0 Summary for N AIRs**:\n- **N kernel launches** on GPU (one per AIR)\n- **1 CPU reconstruction** (depends on number of distinct heights, not N directly)\n- **Memory**: Per-AIR temporary buffers allocated/deallocated\n\n#### **Round k (k=1..n_stack): MLE Sumcheck** (stacked_reduction.rs:794-912)\n\n**File**: `/home/georg/stark-backend/crates/cuda-backend/src/stacked_reduction.rs:832-912`\n\nPer-AIR kernel launch pattern:\n```rust\nlet mut s_evals_batch = Vec::with_capacity(self.ht_diff_idxs.len() - 1);\nfor window in self.ht_diff_idxs.windows(2) {  // One window per AIR\n    let window_len = window[1] - window[0];\n    let unstacked_cols_ptr = unsafe { self.d_unstacked_cols.as_ptr().add(window[0]) };\n    let lambda_pows_ptr = unsafe { self.d_lambda_pows.as_ptr().add(2 * window[0]) };\n    \n    let log_height = self.unstacked_cols[window[0]].log_height as usize;\n    \n    self.d_accum.fill_zero()?;  // Reset accumulator for this AIR\n    \n    if log_height < l_skip + round {\n        // Degenerate case (small AIRs with striding)\n        unsafe {\n            stacked_reduction_sumcheck_mle_round_degenerate(\n                &self.d_q_eval_ptrs,      // All AIRs' q_evals\n                &self.d_eq_ub,\n                eq_r,\n                k_rot_r,\n                unstacked_cols_ptr,       // This AIR's columns\n                lambda_pows_ptr,\n                &mut self.d_accum,        // This AIR's accumulator\n                stacked_height,\n                window_len,               // This AIR's column count\n                l_skip,\n                round,\n            )\n        }\n    } else {\n        // Non-degenerate case (normal AIRs)\n        let hypercube_dim = log_height - l_skip - round;\n        let num_y = 1 << hypercube_dim