{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01JsJo6ikxn2FLE1frV6Y6S1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Performance Analysis Summary\n\n**Current APC 300 STARK excl trace breakdown (2464ms):**\n- Round 0: 662ms — GPU ~462ms, CPU ~200ms (3×iDFT/transpose per AIR + interaction DAG prep)\n- LogUp GKR: 790ms — large batched kernels, scales somewhat\n- Stacked Reduction: 318ms — GPU ~120ms, CPU ~198ms (15,424 tiny kernel launches)\n- Trace Commit: 406ms\n- MLE Rounds: 180ms — mostly well-batched\n- WHIR: 101ms\n\n**Scaling from APC 0→300 (99→623 AIRs, 2.35x fewer cells):**\n- Round 0: 177ms → 662ms (+485ms, 3.7x worse) — biggest absolute regression\n- Stacked Reduction: 114ms → 318ms (+204ms, 2.79x worse)\n\n## Optimization Ideas\n\n| # | Idea | Expected Impact | Probability | Complexity | EV Score |\n|---|------|----------------|-------------|------------|----------|\n| 1 | **Parallelize Round 0 CPU post-processing with rayon** | ~140-184ms (21-28% Round 0) | High | Low-Moderate | **92** |\n| 2 | Batch stacked reduction MLE round kernels | ~100-150ms (31-47% SR) | Medium-High | Moderate | 47 |\n| 3 | Multi-stream Round 0 with CPU-GPU overlap | ~150-200ms | Medium | Complex | 35 |\n| 4 | Move Round 0 iDFT to GPU kernel | ~150-200ms | Medium | Complex | 35 |\n| 5 | Fuse small AIR constraint kernels | ~50-100ms | Medium | Complex | 14 |\n\n**Selected: Idea #1** — Highest EV by a wide margin.\n\nThe previous task (reverted) restructured Round 0 into 3 phases but processed CPU post-processing **sequentially** in Phase C — saving only 3% from sync elimination. The critical missing step was **parallelizing** Phase C with rayon. With 32 cores, the ~200ms of serial CPU work (transpose + iDFT × 3 per AIR for 623 AIRs) drops to ~7-13ms.\n\nNow let me write the task and plan."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1450,"cache_read_input_tokens":95116,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1450},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f1ad9314-c536-427a-92c1-585cbcf5d248","uuid":"c2ea8574-4c61-49f3-911e-f8c62deb057a"}
